# Plans

One file per task: `YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md`, written by the `plan` skill, approved before any code, and
executed by the `implement` skill in a fresh session. Plans are kept after merge as a record.

## Structure

```markdown
# <Goal in one line>

- **Source:** #<issue> | docs/pbi/<file> | request
- **Status:** draft | approved | in progress | done

## Goal
## Context
## Acceptance criteria
- [ ] <testable criterion>
## Out of scope
## Approach
<chosen design> — rejected: <alternative> because <reason>
## Risks and guardrails
## Data and compliance impact
<new personal data? new processor? retention? — or "none">
## Slices
- [ ] 1. <small step> — test: <the test that proves it>
## Verification
<what `verify --full` covers, plus any manual check>
```
